<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />

  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
  />

  <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />

  <title>HumanKey Protocol | Hash Humanity</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Learn how HumanKey uses liveness, biometric uniqueness checks, privacy-preserving proofs, and passkeys to support one human, one account on Hash Humanity."
  />

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large" />

  <link rel="icon" href="logo.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="logo.png" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #000;
      --text: #f5f5f7;
      --muted: #a1a1a6;
      --dim: #6e6e73;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      --line-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      --surface: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
      --max: 1180px;
      --reading: 780px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      background: #000;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      overflow-x: hidden;

      color: var(--text);

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 50% -4%,
          rgba(255,255,255,.065),
          transparent 25%
        ),
        #000;

      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "SF Pro Display",
        "SF Pro Text",
        "Helvetica Neue",
        Arial,
        sans-serif;

      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    button,
    a {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .reading {
      width: min(100%, var(--reading));
    }

    /* HEADER */

    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      z-index: 1000;

      padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top);

      background: rgba(0,0,0,.76);

      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(140%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(140%);

      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);
    }

    .header-inner {
      height: 62px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;

      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 9px;

      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 650;

      letter-spacing: -.02em;

      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 27px;
      height: 27px;

      object-fit: contain;

      filter:
        grayscale(1)
        brightness(0)
        invert(1);

      background: transparent !important;
      border: 0 !important;
      border-radius: 0 !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }

    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 7px;
    }

    .header-link {
      padding: 8px 10px;

      color: #d1d1d5;

      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 550;
    }

    .header-enter {
      min-height: 35px;

      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      padding: 0 14px;

      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      border-radius: 8px;

      background: rgba(255,255,255,.055);

      color: #fff;

      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    /* HERO */

    .hero {
      padding-top: 136px;
      padding-bottom: 70px;
    }

    .eyebrow,
    .section-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 8px;

      color: #99999f;

      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;

      letter-spacing: .16em;

      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background: #fff;

      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,255,255,.75);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 1000px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(62px, 8vw, 108px);

      line-height: .91;

      letter-spacing: -.067em;

      font-weight: 680;
    }

    .hero h1 em {
      color: #7d7d82;

      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 560;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      max-width: 760px;

      margin: 28px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.7vw, 22px);

      line-height: 1.5;

      letter-spacing: -.022em;
    }

    .hero-lead strong {
      color: #f3f3f5;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* CORE STATEMENT */

    .core {
      padding: 54px 0 64px;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .core-grid {
      display: grid;

      grid-template-columns: .65fr 1.35fr;

      gap: 50px;
    }

    .core h2 {
      margin: 0;

      max-width: 800px;

      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);

      line-height: 1;

      letter-spacing: -.052em;

      font-weight: 640;
    }

    .core h2 em {
      color: #7f7f84;

      font-style: normal;
    }

    .core p {
      max-width: 720px;

      margin: 22px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 18px;

      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* 1:1 */

    .ratio-section {
      padding: 62px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .ratio {
      margin: 18px 0 12px;

      font-size: clamp(100px, 19vw, 230px);

      line-height: .82;

      letter-spacing: -.09em;

      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .ratio-labels {
      max-width: 610px;

      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;

      color: #76767b;

      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;

      letter-spacing: .16em;

      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .ratio-copy {
      max-width: 730px;

      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .ratio-copy h2 {
      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(38px, 4.6vw, 62px);

      line-height: 1;

      letter-spacing: -.05em;
    }

    .ratio-copy p {
      margin: 20px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 18px;

      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* FLOW */

    .flow-section {
      padding: 62px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 800px;

      margin: 15px 0 0;

      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);

      line-height: 1;

      letter-spacing: -.052em;

      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .section-intro {
      max-width: 720px;

      margin: 20px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 18px;

      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .flow {
      margin-top: 38px;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .flow-step {
      display: grid;

      grid-template-columns: 70px 250px 1fr;

      gap: 24px;

      padding: 27px 0;

      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .step-number {
      color: #66666b;

      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .flow-step h3 {
      margin: 0;

      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 620;

      letter-spacing: -.025em;
    }

    .flow-step p {
      max-width: 650px;

      margin: 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 15px;

      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* BIOMETRICS */

    .biometrics {
      padding: 66px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .biometric-lead {
      max-width: 790px;

      margin: 21px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 19px;

      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .biometric-grid {
      display: grid;

      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

      gap: 12px;

      margin-top: 38px;
    }

    .info-card {
      padding: 25px;

      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,.035),
          rgba(255,255,255,.012)
        );
    }

    .info-card h3 {
      margin: 0;

      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 620;

      letter-spacing: -.025em;
    }

    .info-card p {
      margin: 12px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 14px;

      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* PRIVACY */

    .privacy {
      padding: 66px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .privacy-statement {
      max-width: 970px;

      margin: 17px 0 0;

      font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 84px);

      line-height: .96;

      letter-spacing: -.06em;

      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .privacy-statement em {
      color: #77777c;

      font-style: normal;
    }

    .privacy-copy {
      max-width: 740px;

      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .privacy-copy p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 17px;

      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* PASSKEY */

    .passkey {
      padding: 66px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .passkey-grid {
      display: grid;

      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;

      gap: 58px;
    }

    .passkey h2 {
      margin: 14px 0 0;

      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);

      line-height: 1;

      letter-spacing: -.052em;
    }

    .passkey-copy {
      padding-top: 25px;
    }

    .passkey-copy p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 17px;

      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* RECOVERY */

    .recovery {
      padding: 66px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .recovery-box {
      margin-top: 32px;

      padding: 30px;

      border: 1px solid var(--line);

      border-radius: 18px;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 90% 0%,
          rgba(255,255,255,.06),
          transparent 28%
        ),
        rgba(255,255,255,.02);
    }

    .recovery-box h3 {
      margin: 0;

      font-size: 26px;

      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .recovery-box p {
      max-width: 720px;

      margin: 14px 0 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* SECURITY */

    .security {
      padding: 66px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .security-list {
      margin-top: 34px;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .security-row {
      display: grid;

      grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;

      gap: 35px;

      padding: 23px 0;

      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .security-row strong {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 620;
    }

    .security-row span {
      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 15px;

      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* LIMITS */

    .limits {
      padding: 66px 0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .limits h2 {
      max-width: 950px;

      margin: 16px 0 0;

      font-size: clamp(45px, 5.8vw, 78px);

      line-height: .97;

      letter-spacing: -.058em;

      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .limits h2 em {
      color: #77777c;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .limits-copy {
      max-width: 750px;

      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .limits-copy p {
      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 17px;

      line-height: 1.62;
    }

    /* FINAL */

    .final {
      padding: 72px 0 62px;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);

      text-align: center;
    }

    .final h2 {
      max-width: 850px;

      margin: 15px auto 0;

      font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 94px);

      line-height: .91;

      letter-spacing: -.067em;
    }

    .final h2 em {
      color: #7c7c81;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .final p {
      max-width: 650px;

      margin: 23px auto 0;

      color: var(--muted);

      font-size: 17px;

      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .final-actions {
      margin-top: 27px;

      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;

      gap: 9px;

      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 46px;

      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      padding: 0 18px;

      border-radius: 9px;

      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);

      background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);

      color: #fff;
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    .site-footer {
      padding:
        22px 0
        calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);

      color: #77777c;

      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 15px;

      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* MOBILE */

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .wrap {
        width: calc(100% - 24px);
      }

      .header-inner {
        height: 56px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .brand img {
        width: 25px;
        height: 25px;
      }

      .header-link {
        display: none;
      }

      .header-enter {
        min-height: 32px;

        padding: 0 11px;

        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 94px;
        padding-bottom: 46px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 16px;

        font-size: 9px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        max-width: 590px;

        font-size: clamp(51px, 14vw, 76px);
      }

      .hero-lead {
        margin-top: 20px;

        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .core,
      .ratio-section,
      .flow-section,
      .biometrics,
      .privacy,
      .passkey,
      .recovery,
      .security,
      .limits {
        padding: 48px 0;
      }

      .core-grid,
      .passkey-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;

        gap: 20px;
      }

      .core h2,
      .section-heading,
      .passkey h2 {
        font-size: clamp(39px, 10.5vw, 55px);
      }

      .core p,
      .section-intro,
      .biometric-lead {
        margin-top: 17px;

        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .ratio {
        margin-top: 18px;

        font-size: clamp(100px, 34vw, 155px);
      }

      .ratio-labels {
        max-width: 410px;
      }

      .ratio-copy {
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .ratio-copy h2 {
        font-size: clamp(36px, 9.5vw, 49px);
      }

      .ratio-copy p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .flow {
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .flow-step {
        grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;

        gap: 12px;

        padding: 22px 0;
      }

      .flow-step p {
        grid-column: 2;

        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .flow-step h3 {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .biometric-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;

        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .info-card {
        padding: 20px;

        border-radius: 14px;
      }

      .privacy-statement {
        font-size: clamp(43px, 11.5vw, 60px);
      }

      .privacy-copy {
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .privacy-copy p,
      .passkey-copy p,
      .limits-copy p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .passkey-copy {
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      .recovery-box {
        margin-top: 25px;

        padding: 21px;

        border-radius: 14px;
      }

      .security-list {
        margin-top: 27px;
      }

      .security-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;

        gap: 8px;

        padding: 20px 0;
      }

      .security-row span {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .limits h2 {
        font-size: clamp(41px, 10.5vw, 57px);
      }

      .final {
        padding: 52px 0 48px;
      }

      .final h2 {
        font-size: clamp(49px, 13vw, 70px);
      }

      .final p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        justify-content: center;

        text-align: center;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 430px) {
      .wrap {
        width: calc(100% - 18px);
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 86px;
        padding-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(47px, 13.5vw, 60px);
      }

      .core,
      .ratio-section,
      .flow-section,
      .biometrics,
      .privacy,
      .passkey,
      .recovery,
      .security,
      .limits {
        padding: 43px 0;
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;

        max-width: 330px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap header-inner">

      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <img src="logo.png" alt="Hash Humanity logo" />
        <span>Hash Humanity</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="header-actions">
        <a class="header-link" href="mission.html">
          Mission
        </a>

        <a
          class="header-enter"
          href="https://hashhumanity.world/universe"
        >
          Enter
        </a>
      </nav>

    </div>
  </header>


  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->

    <section class="hero wrap">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
        HUMANKEY PROTOCOL
      </div>

      <h1>
        Prove you are human.<br />
        <em>Not who you are.</em>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-lead">
        HumanKey is the proof-of-personhood system behind Hash Humanity.
        It combines liveness detection, biometric uniqueness checks,
        privacy-preserving account controls, and passkeys to support one
        simple rule: <strong>one human, one account.</strong>
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- WHAT IT IS -->

    <section class="core">

      <div class="wrap core-grid">

        <div>
          <span class="section-label">
            WHAT HUMANKEY DOES
          </span>
        </div>

        <div>

          <h2>
            We need to know that you are a person.
            <em>We do not need your public identity.</em>
          </h2>

          <p>
            Most websites prove that someone controls an email address,
            phone number, password, or device. That does not prove that
            every account belongs to a different human being. HumanKey
            approaches the problem differently. Before an account is
            established, the system checks for a live human and checks
            whether that person appears to have already enrolled.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ONE HUMAN -->

    <section class="ratio-section">

      <div class="wrap">

        <span class="section-label">
          THE RULE
        </span>

        <div class="ratio">
          1:1
        </div>

        <div class="ratio-labels">
          <span>ONE HUMAN</span>
          <span>ONE ACCOUNT</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ratio-copy">

          <h2>
            Another email should not mean another identity.
          </h2>

          <p>
            Creating another email address is easy. Creating another
            username is easy. Software can automate both. HumanKey is
            designed so that creating another account requires another
            unique human being, not simply another credential.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FLOW -->

    <section class="flow-section">

      <div class="wrap">

        <span class="section-label">
          HOW IT WORKS
        </span>

        <h2 class="section-heading">
          From person to HumanKey.
        </h2>

        <p class="section-intro">
          HumanKey separates proof of personhood from everyday
          authentication. The biometric process establishes human
          uniqueness during enrollment. After enrollment, the account
          can use a passkey for normal authentication.
        </p>


        <div class="flow">

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">01</span>

            <h3>Consent</h3>

            <p>
              Biometric processing begins only after the user is shown
              the HumanKey process and provides consent. The camera is
              not intended to perform silent background verification.
            